# Rebuild stock config for an STM32F031 with 32 KB of flash (the x6 part, on
# Recore A7/A8). flash-stm32 reads the chip's flash size register and uses
# this config's build on a 32 KB part, stm32f031-16k's on a 16 KB one.
#
# Everything Klipper offers on this chip is on - its defaults: 24.3 KB on
# Klipper v0.13.0-786, 8.5 KB free. Switch features off in
# printer_data/config/firmware/stm32.config to make room for something else.
CONFIG_LOW_LEVEL_OPTIONS=y
CONFIG_MACH_STM32=y
CONFIG_MACH_STM32F031=y
CONFIG_STM32_FLASH_START_0000=y
CONFIG_STM32_CLOCK_REF_INTERNAL=y
CONFIG_STM32_SERIAL_USART2_ALT_PA15_PA14=y
